{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/6edccd1a78425041b12cb96f94926ff6.avif?t=1769271516\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/2254f603e8d464b45c4bab26bafed650.poster.avif?t=1769271516\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/2254f603e8d464b45c4bab26bafed650.webm?t=1769271516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/2254f603e8d464b45c4bab26bafed650.mp4?t=1769271516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone starts with a basket of random eggs to hide. Be creative \u2014 find the most unthinkable spots, reach places no one else can, or hide in plain sight to bluff your friends. During the hiding phase, everyone is invisible, but you can still see footprints and hear the sounds of eggs being placed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the seeking phase begins, race to find as many eggs as possible and set traps to slow your friends down! Interact with the environment and place fake eggs to trick them onto a false path. In the end, reveal your hiding spots \u2014 and get ready for your friends to scream, \u201cHow didn\u2019t I see that?!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/fbdc7a1d02d4cb02919548fc4955f3c8.avif?t=1769271516\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/e688ca6f68419b57e913d06d3227db9a.poster.avif?t=1769271516\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/e688ca6f68419b57e913d06d3227db9a.webm?t=1769271516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/e688ca6f68419b57e913d06d3227db9a.mp4?t=1769271516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the spotlight as contestants in a chaotic game show and compete in mini-tournaments! Meet your friends backstage to set up your matches just the way you like \u2014 choose maps, time limits, items, gadgets, and more. The entire arena is a massive LED dome that can display anything, transforming with each map and event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also just hang out backstage or inside the dome \u2014 get creative and make up your own games!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/dbc4fb7a4c2cf26ae059e9e372cc36f4.avif?t=1769271516\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\u20134 player online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer egg hunts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide and Seek together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiders VS Seekers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op egg hunt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill Sandbox</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple maps (WIP)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization (WIP)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990510?t=1769271516","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990510?t=1769271516","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/962493f80f60438b157dbc5678667e5b30958e75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769271516","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/962493f80f60438b157dbc5678667e5b30958e75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769271516","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/6edccd1a78425041b12cb96f94926ff6.avif?t=1769271516\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/2254f603e8d464b45c4bab26bafed650.poster.avif?t=1769271516\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/2254f603e8d464b45c4bab26bafed650.webm?t=1769271516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990510/extras/2254f603e8d464b45c4bab26bafed650.mp4?t=1769271516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone starts with a basket of random eggs to hide. Be creative \u2014 find the most unthinkable spots, reach places no one else can, or hide in plain sight to bluff your friends. During the hiding phase, everyone is invisible, but you can still see footprints and hear the sounds of eggs being placed.</p><p class=\